5,0,1,talk,Minako,,"Let's start by observing everyone's behavior. Since it's Day 0, we have no information yet.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to be with you all. Let's try to get along and find the truth together.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. We should remain calm and logical. I'll be watching for any inconsistencies in your words.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A delightful start. I shall endeavor to keep my observations precise, though I suspect the suspense will be the most entertaining part.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Kenji,,This is so exciting! I'll do my best to help everyone find the werewolf!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minako,,"@Kenji, your enthusiasm is great, but remember to stay focused.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"He is such a lively young man, isn't he? It brings a nice energy to our group.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Energy is fine, but we need a strategy. Does anyone have a specific approach for the first few days?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,Perhaps we should simply listen for now. The werewolf often reveals themselves through over-eagerness or unnatural silence.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Kenji,,I'll be super careful! I won't let the werewolf trick me!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minako,,I think Benjamin's point is valid. Let's see who tries too hard to lead or who stays too quiet.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shizue,,That sounds like a wise plan. I will just listen and smile.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,I'll be analyzing the patterns of who agrees with whom. That often reveals the Possessed.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mizuki, your analytical nature is quite impressive. I look forward to seeing your conclusions.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm just happy to be here with all of you!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Minako,,I believe we've established a basic mood for the game. I'll pass for now.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Minako,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Shizue,,I am content for today. Let us hope for a peaceful night.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,I have enough for a start. I'll be waiting for tomorrow's developments.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed. I shall retire to my thoughts. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,4,talk,Kenji,,Me too! Goodnight!,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
