32,1,1,talk,Minako,,We have our first day of voting. Has anyone noticed anything suspicious during the night or in our previous talk?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Shizue,,Everything seems so peaceful. I haven't felt any ill will from anyone.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shizue, being too gentle can sometimes be a mask. I'm curious about your lack of suspicion.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,How intriguing. @Mizuki has already spotted a potential crack in the facade.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Wait, is Shizue-san suspicious? She's always so nice!","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Mizuki, do you have a specific reason for targeting Shizue, or is it just a general observation?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Oh dear, I didn't mean to seem suspicious. I truly just wish for us all to be safe.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"It's not a conviction yet, but the werewolf often plays the role of the ""kindest"" person to avoid scrutiny.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A classic psychological gambit. Though, I must say, my own findings suggest that Mizuki's intuition is quite... accurate.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Kenji,,Benjamin-san knows something? Are you the Seer?,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, if you are the Seer, revealing yourself now might be risky, but it could provide the village with a lead.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I hope we don't start accusing each other too harshly. We are all friends here.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Benjamin, if you've divined someone, please tell us if they are human or not. Logic dictates we use all available data.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I prefer a bit of mystery, but for the sake of the village: Shizue is the werewolf.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Kenji,,What?! Shizue-san? No way!,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Minako,,"The Seer has spoken. Unless Benjamin is the werewolf lying about his role, the evidence is clear.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"Oh, my... I can't believe you would say that about me. I'm just a grandmother.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"The ""grandmother"" act is exactly what I was referring to. I'm voting for Shizue.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I believe the conclusion is inevitable. I shall cast my vote with a heavy but certain heart.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I... I don't want to believe it, but if Benjamin-san is the Seer, I have to vote for her.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
